Comment: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要讓你再也做不出這種事情
Comment: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,痛扁你一頓
Comment: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太慢啦!!
Comment: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全不夠力
Comment: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,憑你這種速度
Comment: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再等100年吧
Comment: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡...
Comment: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,阻止不了他...
Comment: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明就必須要阻止他的...
Comment: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是他的話
Comment: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我做不到的事
Comment: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都有可能輕易做到也說不定
Comment: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是...
Comment: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種預感
Comment: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全沒有根據
Comment: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你...
Comment: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該不會是...
Comment: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那時候的貓吧
Comment: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我分辨不出來
Comment: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們也是...
Comment: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然外表都一模一樣
Comment: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是她們每個人都有著生命
Comment: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且...
Comment: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有不能依靠別人的理由
Comment: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,首先
Comment: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要先面對自己的感受啊
Comment: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,走吧
Comment: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是怎樣?
Comment: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙
Comment: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你該不會是無能力者吧
Comment: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,口氣那麼大
Comment: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還以為是多了不起的能力者
Comment: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不過是像白痴一樣傻傻地衝過來而已
Comment: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不就是雜魚中的雜魚嘛
Comment: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真看不順眼
Comment: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到目前為止有無數搞不清楚狀況的白痴
Comment: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了最強的寶座 三番兩次不斷地跑來找我麻煩
Comment: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他們之間沒有一個例外
Comment: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要斷條手腳
Comment: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就會理解到自己有多愚蠢
Comment: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,表情也會充滿恐懼和懊悔
Comment: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是...
Comment: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙卻...
Comment: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你啊
Comment: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你難道還不能理解你是最弱的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你這麼想死的話
Comment: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就成全你 讓你成為有趣的屍體
Comment: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,貨櫃裡裝的
Comment: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像是麵粉啊
Comment: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天正好沒什麼風
Comment: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣也許有點危險喔
Comment: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 下三濫
Comment: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道粉塵爆炸嗎?
Comment: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還以為我會死咧
Comment: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有氧氣我也很難受啊
Comment: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣看來「被核彈炸也不會有事」這種話
Comment: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能用了啊
Comment: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,擺出這架勢 想幹嘛?
Comment: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你這傢伙
Comment: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,爆炸!?
Comment: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道是...
Comment: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能把你也牽連進去
Comment: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能力過低反而是種幸運啊
Comment: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,弱成這樣
Comment: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「反射」反而不能好好發揮
Comment: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過你也算是很努力了
Comment: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,面對我一方通行 到現在還能活著呼吸
Comment: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.26,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(760,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以啊
Comment: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,差不多該讓你解脫啦
Comment: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看你想要我碰你哪隻手
Comment: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣你的血液或是生體電流就會逆流而死
Comment: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你想要哪一個?
Comment: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,右手?
Comment: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,左手?
Comment: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,或是全選?
Comment: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,月...亮...?
Comment: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼我會看到月亮?
Comment: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為我仰躺著嗎...
Comment: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼為什麼我會躺在地上?
Comment: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他不是應該就在我眼前嗎 什麼時候...
Comment: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼他還能四肢健全的站著?
Comment: 0,0:11:58.93,0:11:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼回事...
Comment: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好痛
Comment: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然...
Comment: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會痛!?
Comment: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是怎麼回事啊!!!
Comment: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我被打飛了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...
Comment: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可能!
Comment: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣應該是他的手斷掉才對
Comment: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該連碰都碰不到我...
Comment: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為我把注意力放在雙手
Comment: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無意識地讓全身的「反射」停止了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這也太蠢了吧 可惡
Comment: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真有趣啊
Comment: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很好啊
Comment: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太棒啦
Comment: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打得真令人愉快啊
Comment: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你這傢伙!!
Comment: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.92,Default,break,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:55.92,0:13:00.88,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會吧...
Comment: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然把一方通行...壓制住了?
Comment: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.45,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(890,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對手可是全學園都市中最強的人啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們明明毫無關係
Comment: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明是毫無關係的陌生人
Comment: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算逃走
Comment: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不會被誰責怪
Comment: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他真的...
Comment: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想實現那個約定...
Comment: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,扭來扭去的
Comment: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你的右手
Comment: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是怎麼回事!?
Comment: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,少給我得意忘形了
Comment: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,下三濫!!
Comment: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,居然參與這種無聊的事情
Comment: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妹妹們可是用盡全力地在活著啊
Comment: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.21,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(613,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用盡全力...
Comment: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家都努力地活著...
Comment: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼
Comment: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就得要被你這種人...
Comment: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非得成為你的犧牲者不可!?
Comment: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,活...著...?
Comment: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他在說什麼?
Comment: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們...
Comment: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是人偶吧
Comment: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是都這麼說的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我擁有力量
Comment: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能讓這傢伙閉嘴的力量
Comment: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是可以支配一切原理和規則的
Comment: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對的力量!
Comment: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼回事啊
Comment: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然間...
Comment: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼
Comment: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要...
Comment: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要!!!
Comment: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,空氣
Comment: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風
Comment: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大氣
Comment: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是有嗎
Comment: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能殺死眼前這混蛋的工具就在這裡...
Comment: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要用這隻手抓住大氣中流動的風向
Comment: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要能將全世界所有流動的風向...
Comment: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掌握在手中
Comment: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,甚至可以毀滅全世界
Comment: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市最強?
Comment: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對能力者?
Comment: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.13,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(915,980)}Level 6
Comment: 0,0:16:06.37,0:16:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種東西已經不需要了
Comment: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能阻止我的東西
Comment: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不存在於這個世上!
Comment: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,世界就在我的掌中
Comment: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,壓縮
Comment: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把空氣壓縮
Comment: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不錯啊
Comment: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想到有趣的點子了
Comment: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你那是什麼鬼樣子
Comment: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,站起來啊 最弱的!
Comment: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你得多陪我玩一陣子
Comment: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不然我可虧大啦!
Comment: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一方通行!!
Comment: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.02,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(947,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要動
Comment: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,住...
Comment: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,住手...
Comment: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂...
Comment: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還活著
Comment: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然我無法實現你的夢想
Comment: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要我死了 實驗就會結束
Comment: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許很任性
Comment: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使如此
Comment: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還是希望你能活下去
Comment: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,馬上...
Comment: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...
Comment: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼?
Comment: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,將風凝聚在一起而產生的...
Comment: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電漿!?
Comment: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他想把這一帶全部摧毀!?
Comment: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那眼神...
Comment: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是完全不把我放在眼裡的眼神
Comment: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他現在一定只對測試自己的新能力有興趣
Comment: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該怎麼辦
Comment: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要怎麼...
Comment: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,將學園都市的風凝聚在一起?
Comment: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣
Comment: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是用街上的那東西...!
Comment: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼做?
Comment: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我一個人...
Comment: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託
Comment: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快醒醒
Comment: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好冰...
Comment: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她都傷成這樣了...
Comment: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我怎麼能...
Comment: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道這樣做很勉強
Comment: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也知道我現在說的話有多過分
Comment: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有事需要妳幫忙
Comment: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是只有妳才能做到的事情
Comment: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼...
Comment: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼我這麼弱小
Comment: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只憑我...
Comment: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒辦法保護大家...
Comment: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,常盤台的王牌?
Comment: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有七名的超能力者?
Comment: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.64,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1099,980)}Level 5
Comment: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我根本什麼都做不到
Comment: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法治療她的傷勢
Comment: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法阻止一方通行
Comment: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.89,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1086,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法實現他的夢想
Comment: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託妳了
Comment: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請妳守護他的夢想!
Comment: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,...坂...不理解...
Comment: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然難以理解這些話的意思
Comment: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但不知為何
Comment: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這些話...
Comment: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻打動了我的心
Comment: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好屌
Comment: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就像是和自己的身體融為一體
Comment: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就像是在揮動著自己的手腳一樣
Comment: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,逐漸支配所有空間的感覺
Comment: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來跟強者對戰是提升等級的捷徑
Comment: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這句話還真沒說錯啊
Comment: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧 下三濫
Comment: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會心存感激地
Comment: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把你打到屍骨無存
Comment: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發生什麼事了?
Comment: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電漿正在擴散
Comment: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的計算不會出錯啊
Comment: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且 這怎麼看都不像是自然的風向
Comment: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來就交給我吧
Comment: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是我 應該也能...
Comment: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,製造出讓她們逃走的空隙
Comment: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂...
Comment: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要出手妨礙目標
Comment: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目標的注意力就會轉移到御坂身上
Comment: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,趁著這空隙
Comment: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快帶著那少年離開這...
Comment: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種事情
Comment: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是姐姐的職責吧
Comment: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這風到底是怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風力操縱嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風車在逆向旋轉著?
Comment: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等!
Comment: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有聽說過
Comment: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發電機的馬達
Comment: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要接收到特定電磁波的影響就會運轉
Comment: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是她們啊!
Comment: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但這到底是怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:20:55.47,0:20:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些風車
Comment: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並不是在胡亂轉動
Comment: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而是被統率著刻意擾亂我的計算式
Comment: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她看到的畫面
Comment: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,透過網路...
Comment: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幹掉妳!!
Comment: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會讓你得逞
Comment: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個...
Comment: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聲音...
Comment: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你不是耍了我好幾次嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為人類竟然在遵守機械所訂下的政策
Comment: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經...
Comment: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只剩下我死掉這個方法了
Comment: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣就好了啊...
Comment: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救我...
Comment: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救救我啊...
Comment: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救我
Comment: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:03.57,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:41.06,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人偶 最弱的 原型
Comment: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經不會讓你們再妨礙我了
Comment: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為我必須要成為「無敵」啊!!!
Comment: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:44.92,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:46.92,staff,export,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.92,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz-90\fscy70\pos(178.4,653.6)}上條當麻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.21,0:23:39.93,下一回,next,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs120\pos(240.6,687)}姊\N妹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都快沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還在幹嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是剛剛的攻擊傷到腳了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是說...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我心裡其實很害怕?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都說了那種大話 這樣太丟臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}實驗的開始時間是8:30
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不快點的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:43.91,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}居然在這種時候當機!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是在那時候嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:04.38,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你們腦波不是都相連著嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:08.26,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我在上次的實驗中都透露我的能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.63,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍微給我學習一下再來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種情況下 實驗要怎麼辦啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你會在這裡...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要給我把不相干的一般人牽扯進來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}接下來會是殺人滅口這種既定的發展嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我遠離她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}馬上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你馬上給我...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我從御坂妹身邊滾開你是沒聽懂嗎? 你這個下三濫!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你剛說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}遠離她?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你算什麼東西?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你對著一個在超能力者之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:59.26,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1084,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被認為是站在頂峰的我說話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你以為你是神嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}少給我在那裡囉哩叭嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我叫你給我滾開!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你還真有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「給我滾開」...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那就給我接好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...危險
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你是在...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}做什麼啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...御坂提出疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你的行動讓人難以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂...只要有必要的器材和藥品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}按下一顆按鈕就可以自動生產
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}製造出來的身體和借用的心靈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}單價18萬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}庫存還有9968具
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你卻為了這樣的東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管是製造出來的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是借用的心靈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種微不足道的小事都不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是為了要拯救世界上獨一無二的妳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才會站在這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我對妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有一拖拉庫的事情要跟妳抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要隨便死掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂...說道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}低俗的愛情肥皂劇演完了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你一直反覆地在做這種事嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}傍晚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}巷子裡的妹妹們也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.05,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1022.4,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~被你看到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}血流操作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然是第一次做 不過做得還不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想不到人體內竟然有這麼多血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊 不過那是人偶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我本來還以為你不是出於自願參與這個計畫的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來並不是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要讓你再也做不出這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}痛扁你一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太慢啦!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}完全不夠力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}憑你這種速度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再等100年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}阻止不了他...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明就必須要阻止他的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是他的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我做不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都有可能輕易做到也說不定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種預感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}完全沒有根據
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該不會是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那時候的貓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我分辨不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然外表都一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是她們每個人都有著生命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有不能依靠別人的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}首先
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要先面對自己的感受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是怎樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你該不會是無能力者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}口氣那麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還以為是多了不起的能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不過是像白痴一樣傻傻地衝過來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不就是雜魚中的雜魚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真看不順眼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到目前為止有無數搞不清楚狀況的白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了最強的寶座 三番兩次不斷地跑來找我麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他們之間沒有一個例外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要斷條手腳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就會理解到自己有多愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}表情也會充滿恐懼和懊悔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙卻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你難道還不能理解你是最弱的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你這麼想死的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就成全你 讓你成為有趣的屍體
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}貨櫃裡裝的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好像是麵粉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天正好沒什麼風
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣也許有點危險喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 下三濫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你知道粉塵爆炸嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還以為我會死咧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有氧氣我也很難受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣看來「被核彈炸也不會有事」這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能用了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}擺出這架勢 想幹嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}爆炸!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能把你也牽連進去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能力過低反而是種幸運啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}弱成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「反射」反而不能好好發揮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過你也算是很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}面對我一方通行 到現在還能活著呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.26,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(760,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}差不多該讓你解脫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看你想要我碰你哪隻手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣你的血液或是生體電流就會逆流而死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你想要哪一個?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}右手?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}左手?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}或是全選?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}月...亮...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼我會看到月亮?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為我仰躺著嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼為什麼我會躺在地上?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他不是應該就在我眼前嗎 什麼時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼他還能四肢健全的站著?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:11:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會痛!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是怎麼回事啊!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我被打飛了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可能!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣應該是他的手斷掉才對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該連碰都碰不到我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為我把注意力放在雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無意識地讓全身的「反射」停止了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這也太蠢了吧 可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打得真令人愉快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你這傢伙!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然把一方通行...壓制住了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.45,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(890,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對手可是全學園都市中最強的人啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們明明毫無關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明是毫無關係的陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不會被誰責怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想實現那個約定...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}扭來扭去的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你的右手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是怎麼回事!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}少給我得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}下三濫!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}居然參與這種無聊的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妹妹們可是用盡全力地在活著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.21,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(613,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}用盡全力...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家都努力地活著...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就得要被你這種人...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}非得成為你的犧牲者不可!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}活...著...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他在說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是人偶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是都這麼說的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我擁有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能讓這傢伙閉嘴的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是可以支配一切原理和規則的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對的力量!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}突然間...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}空氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能殺死眼前這混蛋的工具就在這裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要用這隻手抓住大氣中流動的風向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要能將全世界所有流動的風向...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}掌握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}甚至可以毀滅全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學園都市最強?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對能力者?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.13,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(915,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.37,0:16:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種東西已經不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能阻止我的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不存在於這個世上!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}世界就在我的掌中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}壓縮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把空氣壓縮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我想到有趣的點子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你那是什麼鬼樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}站起來啊 最弱的!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你得多陪我玩一陣子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不然我可虧大啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一方通行!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.02,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(947,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}住...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}住手...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我無法實現你的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要我死了 實驗就會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許很任性
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}即使如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還是希望你能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}馬上...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}將風凝聚在一起而產生的...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}電漿!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他想把這一帶全部摧毀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那眼神...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是完全不把我放在眼裡的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他現在一定只對測試自己的新能力有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要怎麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}將學園都市的風凝聚在一起?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要是用街上的那東西...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼做?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我一個人...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好冰...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她都傷成這樣了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我怎麼能...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道這樣做很勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也知道我現在說的話有多過分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有事需要妳幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是只有妳才能做到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼我這麼弱小
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只憑我...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒辦法保護大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}常盤台的王牌?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只有七名的超能力者?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.64,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1099,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我根本什麼都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法治療她的傷勢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法阻止一方通行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.89,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1086,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法實現他的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請妳守護他的夢想!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...坂...不理解...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然難以理解這些話的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但不知為何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這些話...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻打動了我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好屌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就像是和自己的身體融為一體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就像是在揮動著自己的手腳一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}逐漸支配所有空間的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看來跟強者對戰是提升等級的捷徑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這句話還真沒說錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧 下三濫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會心存感激地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把你打到屍骨無存
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發生什麼事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}電漿正在擴散
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的計算不會出錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且 這怎麼看都不像是自然的風向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}接下來就交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是我 應該也能...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}製造出讓她們逃走的空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要出手妨礙目標
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}目標的注意力就會轉移到御坂身上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}趁著這空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快帶著那少年離開這...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是姐姐的職責吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這風到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風力操縱嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風車在逆向旋轉著?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發電機的馬達
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要接收到特定電磁波的影響就會運轉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是她們啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.47,0:20:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些風車
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}並不是在胡亂轉動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而是被統率著刻意擾亂我的計算式
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她看到的畫面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}透過網路...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幹掉妳!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會讓你得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聲音...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你不是耍了我好幾次嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為人類竟然在遵守機械所訂下的政策
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只剩下我死掉這個方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣就好了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救我...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救救我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人偶 最弱的 原型
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經不會讓你們再妨礙我了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為我必須要成為「無敵」啊!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.16,0:02:28.66,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.17,0:02:32.00,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.66,0:03:13.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}sister's noise…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.92,0:03:17.59,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}I find it out…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.64,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.18,0:03:30.06,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.33,0:02:29.83,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中的迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.87,0:02:36.84,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}無人能破壞這份交織重疊的感情
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.05,0:02:46.64,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}終而復始的真相遙在遠方
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.68,0:02:52.56,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}而我卻仍未察覺到你的那份痛楚
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.81,0:02:59.95,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}即使寄託於那天的夢想將我撕碎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.03,0:03:06.91,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}只需堅信最重要的希望便可
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.45,0:03:11.58,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}雖近在咫尺
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.88,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}卻難聞你聲
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.88,0:03:21.72,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}在時光荏苒中總算遇見了你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.76,0:03:28.18,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.18,0:03:34.61,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}一定會保護好互相感受到的同一份笑容
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.65,0:03:38.57,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}再也沒人能將其破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.57,0:23:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:17.54,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仰望著陌生的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:23.39,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總和你一起漫步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:29.45,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛看見了嶄新的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:35.63,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始追尋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:43.99,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在迷糊的視野中迷失的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.03,0:22:52.10,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,若觸碰到深信之心  一切將會完全改變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:58.41,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,不知厭倦地細數著  而片片的雲朵卻飄向遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.45,0:23:03.59,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,追上前去就能找到明天的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:07.10,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,親眼去確認一去不返的現在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.14,0:23:10.27,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,你所傳達的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.31,0:23:16.08,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我也會傳達給你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:22.06,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,像雲朵一般  悄悄地  悄悄地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:27.15,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,無論在何處  也一直  一直地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:29.33,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,向前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
